#: ../../api/methods/answer_chat_join_request_query.rst:3
msgid "answerChatJoinRequestQuery"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.methods.answer_chat_join_request_query.AnswerChatJoinRequestQuery:1
#: of
msgid ""
"Use this method to process a received chat join request query. Returns "
":code:`True` on success."
msgstr ""
"Обрабатывает полученный запрос на вступление в чат. При успехе возвращает"
" :code:`True`."

#: litegram.methods.answer_chat_join_request_query.AnswerChatJoinRequestQuery:3
#: of
msgid "Source: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#answerchatjoinrequestquery"
msgstr "Источник: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#answerchatjoinrequestquery"

#: litegram.methods.answer_chat_join_request_query.AnswerChatJoinRequestQuery.chat_join_request_query_id:1
#: of
msgid "Unique identifier of the join request query"
msgstr "Уникальный идентификатор запроса на вступление в чат"

#: litegram.methods.answer_chat_join_request_query.AnswerChatJoinRequestQuery.result:1
#: of
msgid ""
"Result of the query. Must be either 'approve' to allow the user to join "
"the chat, 'decline' to disallow the user to join the chat, or 'queue' to "
"leave the decision to other administrators."
msgstr ""
"Решение по запросу: :code:`approve` — разрешить вступление, "
":code:`decline` — отклонить заявку или :code:`queue` — оставить решение "
"другим администраторам."

